"""Registry of every decision rule: statement, parameters, verifying tests, affected results.

docs/rules.md is rendered from this list (scripts/make_docs.py) and
tests/test_docs.py checks that every parameter path exists in
config/params.json, every test exists in the suite and every result key
exists in results/*.json.
"""
